<description>&lt;p&gt;Chinese coast guard and navy vessels are conducting combat-readiness patrols, water-cannon drills, and have deployed the carrier Liaoning into the western Pacific, prompting alarms from the Philippines, Taiwan and Japan. The Philippine Coast Guard is delivering fuel to Filipino fishermen at Scarborough Shoal and jointly executing a search-and-rescue exercise with the US Coast Guard in the West Philippine Sea, while a ferry listing off Quezon Province was rescued, saving 58 passengers. Taiwan reports Chinese coast guard ships harassing shipping and entering Dongsha restricted waters. The UCDP recorded 176 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxORUhFT1ltdmVCMy1Lbk5nb2hVOWRxWHQ2SExtR01UbVMzLWtGQnBWTk9uWkdNWGd5TWxvQnV6QnJkSm5RZGVuYnJxcGh4YWJhLU1kLThGZ0RPNHZWbTg1MlJzdFZEeGkzUTU0QlRVZFBrOFFqQVJhVmE5SEhFbG5zRWFiUE03LXozYjE4Rk5OX3NjQWVmOUk2M29PVjd1Znh3Yi13?oc=5&quot;&gt;Asia News Network&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Philstar.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxPQ1BHMTFGNTdORE1nVjI4aWhTd3V6MEZVcDNZSDhBMXpfY0I5T3BlVS0xVFhjY0VnMzRPanRTVHVoUzFjNEtCRzBaZjhVOEpIQmdDODBpa1JhdERDOXU3ZUk3dUtBR3RMNW1ucWp3R2xvNml6aFdWWW9wWUJVa1paOUNZOWFNTFVpMEx3MVNCaHl4Y1lULTktVC1NdEpvUWJHYURsazVsbnFtNDNhUkpkU2FaNWRGNUZFSVE?oc=5&quot;&gt;inkl&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxQQUZaeVN4OGx6QjA3dmxVRUxJaEVtOUpBTUZhX0RPNGFuc2pjckpMX1pMYklRZWpJZVB6eW5rZXVBVnBweV9WOVZWTnNkWFRxYXFrNzJ5Z09rUTdld29QRnV2d2cyVmU4d1dZN1VKS1ljMmtGbl9Fc1dndUotZmdLbkJwZEhVeXk1ZlFWcXc2M0p3eWpGVnRzeEJZN3haRV9V?oc=5&quot;&gt;BusinessToday Malaysia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5